  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/HhIJW8n1/images/bfde9c03d8e75f73b469d51b5f41ef31dc8c29de.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateestrogen%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createe-strogen\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/MayaqqDev/create-estrogen/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/hue\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"Discord\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/MayaqqDev/Estrogen/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/documentation/ghpages_vector.svg&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"維基\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/mayaqq\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<h2>此模組先前包含於 Estrogen 中，請安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/estrogen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Estrogen</a> 以使此模組正常運作</h2>\n<h2><code>資訊</code></h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>[!TIP]\n  <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a></strong> 強烈建議搭配安裝此模組，以便查看所有配方與進度！</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Estrogen 模組的「Create mod」擴充套件！為 Create 模組及其機器增添獨特的機制與互動！</p>\n<h3><code>主要功能</code></h3>\n<p>Create: Estrogen 包含多種不同的機制與配方，核心方塊為離心機（Centrifuge），如下方所示，可讓您將液體加工成新的形態！</p>\n<h3><code>其他功能</code></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>離心機！開啟液體加工的新維度！🎡\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OEAJaSuI/images/19cf9ab76664a206e6b6e4f118ee7db0cc6c76a5.png\" alt=\"離心機\" width=\"256\"></li>\n<li>傳送 Estrogen 時的客製化包裹！📦<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OEAJaSuI/images/ffdb1951f79a5de7735b96f816e672374ec94766.png\" alt=\"Estrogen 包裹\" width=\"256\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><code>額外資訊</code></h3>\n<p>您可以前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/MayaqqDev/Estrogen/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 閱讀更多關於此模組的功能、機制及部分指南！</p>\n<p>此模組仍在開發中，因此可能會遇到一些錯誤或缺失的功能。如果您發現任何錯誤或有建議，請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 上回報。本模組的靈感來自遊戲《Celeste》，非常感謝所有提供想法與功能的貢獻者！</p>\n<h2><code>Bisect 合作夥伴</code></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmayaqq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3af862e4-2c3a-4ae5-9caf-cc9f80d19620.png\" alt=\"優惠碼\"></a></p>\n<h2><code>社群</code></h2>\n<p>如有任何問題或需要支援，可點擊下方按鈕加入我的 Discord！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>",
